# The sync manifest directory at the repository root. It is its own git
# repository with its own remote - content travels between devices
# through that repo, never through the app's. Left un-ignored it would
# also try to become a gitlink here, and a transcript would end up in
# this repository's history, which is the one thing the whole design
# exists to prevent.
#
# Root-anchored deliberately. A bare `sync/` matches any directory of
# that name anywhere - including open_notebook/sync/, the package that
# implements all of this - and silently kept a new module out of git
# while every test passed locally and the bundle shipped without it.
# The phone then served without the module and every call 500'd.
/sync/
ollama_data/
whisper_models/
sidecars/llamacpp-sse2/models/
